  <Title>k__BackingField: "Module 2 Complete \u2014 Well Done"
  <Description>k__BackingField: Congratulations on completing the Packing and Dispatch
    module. Every order you pack correctly is a customer who receives exactly what
    they ordered, on time and undamaged. The decisions you make at the packing bench,
    the right box, the right fill, the right label, the right orientation are small
    in isolation but significant in volume. A team of packers making consistently
    correct decisions is the difference between a high-performing dispatch operation
    and one that spends its day processing returns. You are ready to move to the
    next module.
